<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Vanilla Ideology Expanded - Memes and Structures</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationConditional">
      <success>Always</success>
      <xpath>Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Fishing_Adept"]/description</xpath>
      <match Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
        <mods>
          <li>Odyssey</li>
        </mods>
        <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
          <operations>
            <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
              <xpath>Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Fishing_Adept"]/description</xpath>
              <value>
                <!-- EN: Our adoration for the water and all life within has led us to employ new and subtle techniques for catching as many fish as possible.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Adept fishermen will be able to catch additional fish from fishing zones. These "adept fish" will be caught 20% of the time in a stack of 10, increasing the overall yield of fishing. -->
                <description>Nossa adoração pela água e por toda a vida que abriga nos levou a desenvolver técnicas novas e sutis para capturar o máximo de peixes.\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C&gt;Efeito de jogo:&lt;/color&gt;\n - Pescadores peritos conseguem capturar peixes adicionais nas zonas de pesca. Esses "peixes de perito" são capturados em 20% das tentativas, em pilhas de 10, aumentando o rendimento total da pesca.</description>
              </value>
            </li>
          </operations>
        </match>
        <nomatch Class="PatchOperationSequence">
          <operations>
            <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
              <xpath>Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Fishing_Adept"]/description</xpath>
              <value>
                <!-- EN: Fishing is the right way; ranching and farming is not.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Adept fishermen will be able to catch additional fish from fishing zones. These fish are considered "adept catches" and provide double nutrition from other fish in the same size category. -->
                <description>Pescar é o caminho certo; criar animais e cultivar a terra não.\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C&gt;Efeito de jogo:&lt;/color&gt;\n - Pescadores peritos conseguem capturar peixes adicionais nas zonas de pesca. Esses peixes são considerados "capturas de perito" e fornecem o dobro da nutrição dos outros peixes da mesma categoria de tamanho.</description>
              </value>
            </li>
          </operations>
        </nomatch>
      </match>
    </match>
  </Operation>
</Patch>

